ReachyMini — native Swift client for Reachy Mini Wireless
Copyright 2026 Aleksei Kakoulin

This is an independent, unofficial client for the Reachy Mini robot by
Pollen Robotics (https://www.pollen-robotics.com). It is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Pollen Robotics. "Reachy Mini" is a
product name of Pollen Robotics; it is used here solely to describe
compatibility.

The robot daemon HTTP/WebSocket API behavior was studied from the
Apache-2.0 licensed repositories pollen-robotics/reachy-mini-desktop-app
and pollen-robotics/reachy_mini, which serve as the behavioral
specification for this client. No source code from those repositories is
included in this project.
